[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10087.67, "timestamp": "02:48:07", "text": "是的。你说“我猜是吧”。是的。 S. 等待"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10090.55, "timestamp": "02:48:10", "text": "我猜也是。等待。那里是温泉，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10097.11, "timestamp": "02:48:17", "text": "温泉。是的。我猜是Sa。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10099.51, "timestamp": "02:48:19", "text": "不知道。我们走吧。我们不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10107.83, "timestamp": "02:48:27", "text": "哦，这个地方不错。是的。放松"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10110.469, "timestamp": "02:48:30", "text": "出去，一切都结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10113.19, "timestamp": "02:48:33", "text": "我们很好。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10116.07, "timestamp": "02:48:36", "text": "有个不错的建筑商。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10120.95, "timestamp": "02:48:40", "text": "哦，这里曾经有三四个孩子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10125.83, "timestamp": "02:48:45", "text": "哦，那家伙真够特别的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10128.55, "timestamp": "02:48:48", "text": "好吧，这只是尝试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10131.11, "timestamp": "02:48:51", "text": "他们当然会受到诱惑。哦，他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10134.07, "timestamp": "02:48:54", "text": "t."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10135.75, "timestamp": "02:48:55", "text": "好了，我们走了。我们将要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10139.269, "timestamp": "02:48:59", "text": "那棵巨大的树。那棵大树在哪儿呢？"}]